  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& x^7+14 x^5+16 x^3+30 x-560=0 \\\\\n& \\text { Let } f(x)=x^7+14 x^5+16 x^3+30 x \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow f^{\\prime}(x)=7 x^6+70 x^4+48 x^2+30>0 \\forall x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n$\\therefore f(x)$ is an increasing function $\\forall x$.",
